<text><body><div type="page" n="712"><pb n="712" facs="#f0724"/>
<fw type="header" place="top">Ortskunde des Fürstenthums Reuß j. L.</fw>
<table xml:id="p712-b1" facs="#f0724-b1" rows="9" cols="3"><row role="label"><cell role="label"><placeName ref="#place-lobenstein">Lobenstein</placeName>:</cell><cell role="label"><placeName ref="#place-hirschberg">Hirschberg</placeName>:</cell><cell role="label"><placeName ref="#place-ebersdorf">Ebersdorf</placeName>:</cell></row><row><cell><persName ref="#person-heinrich-iii">Heinrich III.</persName>, † 1710.</cell><cell><persName ref="#person-heinrich-viii">Heinrich VIII.</persName>,</cell><cell><persName ref="#person-heinrich-x">Heinrich X.</persName>, † 1711.</cell></row><row><cell><persName ref="#person-heinrich-xv">Heinrich XV.</persName>, † 1739.</cell><cell>† 1711 ohne Leibeserben.</cell><cell><persName ref="#person-heinrich-xxix">Heinrich XXIX.</persName>, † 1747.</cell></row><row><cell><persName ref="#person-heinrich-ii">Heinrich II.</persName>, † 1782.</cell><cell></cell><cell><persName ref="#person-heinrich-xxiv">Heinrich XXIV.</persName>, † 1779.</cell></row><row><cell><persName ref="#person-heinrich-xxxv-fuerst-reuss-lobenstein">Heinrich XXXV.</persName>,<lb/>† 1805,<lb/>wurde 1790 Reichsfürst<lb/>und 1802 Mitregent von<lb/><placeName ref="#place-gera">Gera</placeName>.</cell><cell>Sein Theil fällt an<lb/>die beiden anderen<lb/>Linien.</cell><cell><persName ref="#person-heinrich-li-fuerst-reuss-ebersdorf">Heinrich LI.</persName>, † 1822,<lb/>wird 1802 Mitregent von<lb/><placeName ref="#place-gera">Gera</placeName> und 1806 Fürst.</cell></row><row role="label"><cell cols="3"><persName ref="#person-heinrich-lxxii-fuerst-reuss-lobenstein-ebersdorf">Heinrich LXXII.</persName>,<lb/>† 1853,</cell></row><row><cell><persName ref="#person-heinrich-liv-fuerst-reuss-lobenstein-selbitz">Heinrich LIV.</persName>, † 1824.</cell><cell></cell><cell>legt 1848 die Regierung</cell></row><row><cell>Die Linie erlischt und ihr<lb/>Land fällt an <placeName ref="#place-ebersdorf">Ebersdorf</placeName>.</cell><cell></cell><cell>nieder und damit hört die<lb/>Speciallinie Lobenstein-</cell></row><row role="label"><cell cols="3">Ebersdorf auf.</cell></row></table>
<p xml:id="p712-b2"><lb n="16" facs="#f0724-l16"/>Nach der 1711 erfolgten Theilung besaß</p>
<table xml:id="p712-b3" facs="#f0724-b3" rows="2" cols="2"><row><cell>die Herrschaft <placeName ref="#place-lobenstein">Lobenstein</placeName>:</cell><cell>die Herrschaft <placeName ref="#place-ebersdorf">Ebersdorf</placeName>:</cell></row><row><cell>die <placeName ref="#place-lobenstein">Stadt Lobenstein</placeName>, eingepfarrt:<lb/><placeName ref="#place-neundorf">Neundorf</placeName> zum Theil,<lb/><placeName ref="#place-langwassermuehle">Langwassermühle</placeName>,<lb/><placeName ref="#place-heinrichsgruen">Heinrichsgrün</placeName>,<lb/><placeName ref="#place-kleinfriesa">Kleinfriesa</placeName>,<lb/><placeName ref="#place-galgenvorwerk">Galgenvorwerk</placeName>,<lb/><placeName ref="#place-saaldorf">Saaldorf</placeName>,<lb/><placeName ref="#place-haueisen">Haueisen</placeName>,<lb/><rs type="concept" ref="#concept-schloesschen">Schlößchen</rs>,<lb/><placeName ref="#place-neuhammer">Neuhammer</placeName>,<lb/><placeName ref="#place-neuhaus">Muckenberger Haus</placeName>,<lb/><rs type="concept" ref="#concept-vitriolwerk">Vitriolwerk</rs>,<lb/><placeName ref="#place-gottliebsthal">Friesenthal</placeName>,<lb/><rs type="concept" ref="#concept-stahlhuette">Stahlhütte</rs>,<lb/><placeName ref="#place-motschenmuehle">Motschenmühle</placeName>,<lb/><rs type="concept" ref="#concept-haemmerchensmuehle">Hämmerchensmühle</rs>,<lb/>Filial <placeName ref="#place-schoenbrunn">Schönbrunn</placeName>;<lb/><placeName ref="#place-froessen">Frössen</placeName>, <placeName ref="#place-pirk">Pirk</placeName>, <placeName ref="#place-pfuetz">Pfütz</placeName>, <placeName ref="#place-pechmuehle">Pechmühle</placeName>, <placeName ref="#place-lehesten">Lehesten</placeName><lb/>und <placeName ref="#place-hohenpreis">Hohenpreis</placeName>;<lb/><placeName ref="#place-blintendorf">Blintendorf</placeName> zum Theil;<lb/><placeName ref="#place-goeritz">Göritz</placeName>;<lb/><placeName ref="#place-harra">Harra</placeName> mit den eingepfarrten Orten:<lb/><placeName ref="#place-lichtenbrunn">Lichtenbrunn</placeName>,<lb/><placeName ref="#place-schlegel">Schlegel</placeName>,<lb/><placeName ref="#place-seibis">Seibis</placeName>,<lb/><placeName ref="#place-kiessling">Kießling</placeName>,<lb/><placeName ref="#place-blankenstein">Blankenstein</placeName>,<lb/><placeName ref="#place-wegnersbach">Wegnersbach</placeName>,<lb/><placeName ref="#place-buttermuehle">Buttermühle</placeName>,<lb/><placeName ref="#place-baerwinkel">Bärwinkel</placeName>,<lb/><placeName ref="#place-eichenstein">Eichenstein</placeName>,<lb/><placeName ref="#place-hoelle-kleinschmidt">Hölle oder Kleinschmidt</placeName>,<lb/>Abhang, Geheeg, Staudenwiese, Sieglizmühle;</cell><cell><placeName ref="#place-ebersdorf">Ebersdorf</placeName>;<lb/><placeName ref="#place-hirschberg">Hirschberg</placeName> nebst <placeName ref="#place-dornholz">Dornholz</placeName>, Hammermühle und Einzelhäuser;<lb/><placeName ref="#place-altengesees">Altengesees</placeName>;<lb/><placeName ref="#place-arlas">Arlas</placeName> reuß. Antheils;<lb/><placeName ref="#place-benignengruen">Benignengrün</placeName> nebst <rs type="concept" ref="#concept-hohenofen">Hohenofen</rs>, Hammermühle, <placeName ref="#place-solmsgruen">Solmsgrün</placeName> und Heinrichshütte;<lb/><placeName ref="#place-blintendorf">Blintendorf</placeName> zum Theil;<lb/><placeName ref="#place-dobareuth">Dobareuth</placeName> und <placeName ref="#place-pfauenbach">Pfauenbach</placeName>;<lb/><placeName ref="#place-duerrenbach">Dürrenbach</placeName> und <placeName ref="#place-heinrichsort">Heinrichsort</placeName> b. Wurzbach;<lb/><placeName ref="#place-eliasbrunn">Eliasbrunn</placeName>;<lb/><placeName ref="#place-gahma">Gahma</placeName> nebst der Zschachen-, Ponzels-<lb/>und <placeName ref="#place-grubersmuehle">Grubersmühle</placeName>;<lb/><placeName ref="#place-gebersreuth">Gebersreuth</placeName>;<lb/><placeName ref="#place-goettengruen">Göttengrün</placeName>;<lb/><placeName ref="#place-grumbach">Grumbach</placeName> nebst Mühlen;<lb/><placeName ref="#place-helmsgruen">Helmsgrün</placeName> und <placeName ref="#place-baerenmuehle">Bärenmühle</placeName>;<lb/><placeName ref="#place-lemnitzhammer">Lemnitzhammer</placeName>, <placeName ref="#place-muehlleite">Mühlleite</placeName> und Saalgrün;<lb/><placeName ref="#place-lothra">Lothra</placeName> nebst Mühle;<lb/><placeName ref="#place-moedlareuth">Mödlareuth</placeName> und <placeName ref="#place-kegelmuehle">Kegelmühle</placeName>;<lb/><placeName ref="#place-neundorf">Neundorf</placeName> zum Theil;<lb/><placeName ref="#place-ossla">Oßla</placeName> nebst <rs type="concept" ref="#concept-obermuehle">Obermühle</rs>, <placeName ref="#place-knauermuehle">Knauermühle</placeName><lb/>und altem Felde;<lb/><placeName ref="#place-pottiga">Pottiga</placeName>, <placeName ref="#place-aumuehle">Aumühle</placeName> und <placeName ref="#place-alaunwerk">Alaunwerk</placeName>;<lb/><placeName ref="#place-rodacherbrunn">Rodacherbrunn</placeName> zum Theil;<lb/><placeName ref="#place-rothenacker">Rothenacker</placeName>;<lb/><placeName ref="#place-roettersdorf">Röttersdorf</placeName>;<lb/><placeName ref="#place-saalbach">Saalbach</placeName>;<lb/><placeName ref="#place-titschendorf">Titschendorf</placeName> mit zwei Mühlen;<lb/><placeName ref="#place-ullersreuth">Ullersreuth</placeName>;<lb/><placeName ref="#place-unterlemnitz">Unterlemnitz</placeName>;</cell></row></table>
</div></body></text>
